        href="https://bsky.app/profile/chriszombik.com"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer noopener"
      >
        Bluesky
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/christopher-zombik-5b085324/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer noopener"
      >
        LinkedIn
      </a>
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="https://welson.net" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">
